  "description": "Armonia has lived alongside monsters all her life. They've raised, protected, and loved her since she was a toddler. So when she heard about a monster hunt that would threaten her monster friends, she saw no other choice but to try and stop it. But to do that, she can no longer avoid interacting with humans. Now, she's on her way to meet the leader of the monster hunt, Kansler Hydeh, in hopes of changing his mind. And if he doesn't listen to her as well as monsters do, Armonia will make him!",
